# Server-only OpenRouter API key. Never expose this to the browser or log it.
# Required for live extraction (model: deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp via OpenRouter).
# Recorded fixture mode works without a key.
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in the value.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# The React SPA (npm run dev) proxies /api to the backend (npm run dev:server).
# Recorded extraction needs dev:server running; it does not need OPENROUTER_API_KEY.
# The client bundle never reads OPENROUTER_API_KEY or any VITE_* secret.
